BattleTower_Interior1_Text_UnionRoomReceptionist::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_BurglarEddieIntro::
	.string "I’ve been to many GYMS, but this\n"
	.string "one best suits my style.$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_BurglarEddieDefeat::
	.string "Yowza!\n"
	.string "Too hot!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_BurglarEddie::
	.string "PONYTA, NINETALES…\n"
	.string "Those are popular FIRE POKéMON.$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "Hi, welcome to the BATTLE TOWER,\n"
	.string "this is a place where tough\l"
	.string "TRAINERS battle with each other.\p"
	.string "Do you want to challenge a\n"
	.string "tough TRAINER now?$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "Okay, good luck, then!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_3::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: BROCK!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_4::
	.string "My POKéMON are impervious to\n"
	.string "most physical attacks.\p"
	.string "You’ll have a hard time\n"
	.string "inflicting any damage.$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat1::
	.string "I’ve lost again...\n"
	.string "You aren’t adventuring around\l"
	.string "for nothing!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_5::
	.string "The winner is: {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Congratulations! We hope to\l"
	.string "see you again in the future!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_6::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: MISTY!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_7::
	.string "I’ve heard a lot of good things\n"
	.string "about you since our last battle.\p"
	.string "Let me test how good you are!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat2::
	.string "Wow! You are getting\n"
	.string "stronger by the battle!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_8::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: LT. SURGE!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_9::
	.string "When it comes to ELECTRIC-type\n"
	.string "POKéMON, I’m number one!\p"
	.string "I’m gonna zap your POKéMON!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat3::
	.string "Oh no! You are very strong!\n"
	.string "But I will repay my debt someday.$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_10::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: SABRINA!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_11::
	.string "I knew you’d come!\n"
	.string "I had a feeling.$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat4::
	.string "I know...\n"
	.string "you will come again sometime.$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_12::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: ERIKA!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_13::
	.string "How are you?\n"
	.string "Good to see you again!\p"
	.string "This place doesn’t really suit me,\n"
	.string "but... let’s ignore that and battle!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat5::
	.string "You have grown even stronger...$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_14::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: JANINE!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_15::
	.string "I can’t use my ninja technique,\n"
	.string "but I won’t let you win!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat6::
	.string "I lost today,\n"
	.string "but I’ll win next time!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_16::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: BLAINE!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_17::
	.string "My fiery POKéMON will incinerate\n"
	.string "all challengers!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat7::
	.string "Whoa hey!\n"
	.string "I’m a raging inferno!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_18::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: BLUE!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_19::
	.string "Good! Thanks for coming\n"
	.string "to lose to me!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat8::
	.string "Just as I expected!\n"
	.string "No wonder you’ve become the\l"
	.string "CHAMPION...$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_20::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: ASHLEE!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_21::
	.string "It’s you again, huh?\n"
	.string "Then we’ve got no choice.\l"
	.string "Let’s go PIKACHU!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat9::
	.string "NO!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_22::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: CARLOS!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_23::
	.string "Now is my chance to crush you!\n"
	.string "Ha!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat10::
	.string "You beat me again?\n"
	.string "But how?!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_24::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: AMELIA!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat11::
	.string "{PLAYER}, you are so strong...$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_25::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: WHITNEY!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_26::
	.string "I’m warning you---I’m good!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat12::
	.string "You really are strong!\n"
	.string "But I won’t lose next time!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_27::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: FALKNER!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_28::
	.string "It’s a pleasure to be able to\n"
	.string "battle you again!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat13::
	.string "Mmm... It’s still a long way\n"
	.string "to become the best TRAINER...$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_29::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: ARD!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_30::
	.string "This time, I will beat you\n"
	.string "with my BUG POKéMON!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_31::
	.string "But... My bugs!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_32::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: BUGSY!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_33::
	.string "Good to see you again!\n"
	.string "Behold my bug research!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat14::
	.string "You must have studied a lot\n"
	.string "about POKéMON!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_34::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: PRYCE!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_35::
	.string "Finally. No need for words.\n"
	.string "A POKéMON battle is the way for\l"
	.string "us to communicate.$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat15::
	.string "Mmm... Impressive!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_36::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: CHUCK!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_37::
	.string "There you are!\n"
	.string "Taste my 24-hour training!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat16::
	.string "Wahaha!\n"
	.string "A battle with you is never boring!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_38::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: JASMINE!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_39::
	.string "Hm... Hi!\n"
	.string "Are you prepared?$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat17::
	.string "True to your reputation...$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_40::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: MORTY!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_41::
	.string "I was just talking about you...\n"
	.string "Let’s battle!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat18::
	.string "I’ve lost again...\n"
	.string "You may have something more\l"
	.string "than just strength.$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_42::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: CLAIR!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_43::
	.string "...You are here.\n"
	.string "Now let’s battle!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_44::
	.string "Way to go.\n"
	.string "...Now give it your all!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_45::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: RED!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_46::
	.string "... ...\n"
	.string "... ...$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_47::
	.string "Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER.\n"
	.string "The TRAINER {PLAYER} will\l"
	.string "face is: {RIVAL}!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_48::
	.string "My well-trained-beyond-recognition\n"
	.string "POKéMON are going to pound you.\p"
	.string "Right now, right here!\n"
	.string "I challenge you!$"

BattleTower_Interior1_Text_Trigger1Defeat19::
	.string "...\n"
	.string "OK. I lost...$"
